{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Floor is...What!?",
    "steam_appid": 1272140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/15e4e063cfd808949a6c2c21f26bf537.avif?t=1734396673\" /></div><br>Experience an epic competition where only the best of the best will survive! Invoke unrelenting carnage across more than 50 minigames designed to test contestants\u2019 patience, coordination, and of course, friendships. Say goodbye to Grandma as you push her into a deadly lava pit from your dungeon perch - haha nerd! Better luck next time to your roommate who got toasted by a falling bomb on the \u201crelaxing\u201d sandy beach. Competitors, ready those reflexes to go head-to-(bobble) head! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/5130c5b11d869c0add0f6e7dcfba148a.poster.avif?t=1734396673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/5130c5b11d869c0add0f6e7dcfba148a.webm?t=1734396673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/5130c5b11d869c0add0f6e7dcfba148a.mp4?t=1734396673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/4655d0b4810d2649a931f4073bc8e425.avif?t=1734396673\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50+ mini games<br></li><li>Free for all, 2v2, 3v1 and various win methods (coins, survival, etc)<br></li><li>Unlock collectibles and use them to create custom characters<br></li><li>Play friends online, in person, or with Steam's Remote Play </li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/119077439860b10d60ea8e9d72b72cbf.avif?t=1734396673\" /></div><br>Enter the arena as a mischievous bobble-head made from collectible components - matched or mismatched to your liking! A grizzly bear head on Santa\u2019s body? Whatever you need to psych out the competition. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose from 200+ collectible toy pieces<br></li><li>Create a crazy name for the announcer to call out during gameplay<br></li><li>Select a &quot;voice pack&quot; for audible emotes during gameplay like jump, hurt, win, and lose<br></li><li>Keep playing to unlock 'mystery toy boxes' for new collectible toys</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/858aeca72f8ece517464a14129e5e181.poster.avif?t=1734396673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/858aeca72f8ece517464a14129e5e181.webm?t=1734396673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/858aeca72f8ece517464a14129e5e181.mp4?t=1734396673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/532230be190713bde3018017b9f8e09c.avif?t=1734396673\" /></div><br>Everyone is welcome: simple controls, adjustable difficulty modes, and CPUs are there to accommodate all skill levels. Test diabolical strategies in practice modes before hopping into competitive tournaments. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple controls with 1-2 buttons<br></li><li>Practice Mode before each game<br></li><li>Three vs. one, two vs. two, or total free-for-all matches<br></li><li>Difficulty Modes for any skill level</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/e57f5051076b81542149567dd3b1acf6.poster.avif?t=1734396673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/e57f5051076b81542149567dd3b1acf6.webm?t=1734396673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272140/extras/e57f5051076b81542149567dd3b1acf6.mp4?t=1734396673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
